<title>USA: Penn Treaty American Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Penn Treaty American Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ALLENTOWN, Pa. 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>PENN TREATY AMERICAN CORPORATION</p>
<p>					  (UNAUDITED)</p>
<p>			  THREE MONTHS ENDED  NINE MONTHS ENDED</p>
<p>			    SEPTEMBER 30,	   SEPTEMBER 30,</p>
<p>			 1996	   1995	   1996	 1995</p>
<p> Revenue:     35,074,993   28,587,612  102,920,466 81,294,150</p>
<p>Benefits and expenses:</p>
<p>		  30,653,216   25,213,778   90,532,699 72,510,915</p>
<p>   Net income  3,097,501    2,369,834    8,673,491  6,148,235</p>
<p>Earnings per share  </p>
<p>			  0.43	   0.35	   1.23	 1.15</p>
<p>Weighted average number</p>
<p>of shares outstanding</p>
<p>		   7,178,976    6,736,501    7,057,317  5,367,255</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
